{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"04.03","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":79,"reply_count":37,"alternative_count":13,"total_audio_count":129,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"04.03.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"几位？","meaning_my":"လူဘယ်နှယောက်လဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"两位。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်ပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"两位。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်ပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"有位置吗？","meaning_my":"ထိုင်စရာ နေရာလွတ် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，这边请。","meaning_my":"ရှိပါတယ်၊ ဒီဘက်ကြွပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"还有空桌吗？","meaning_my":"စားပွဲလွတ် ရှိသေးလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"要排队吗？","meaning_my":"တန်းစီစောင့်ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"要，麻烦先取号。","meaning_my":"စောင့်ရမယ်၊ အရင် အလှည့်နံပါတ် ယူပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"等位要等多久？","meaning_my":"နေရာရဖို့ ဘယ်လောက်ကြာ စောင့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"现在大概要等十分钟。","meaning_my":"အခု ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် စောင့်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"取号机在哪儿？","meaning_my":"အလှည့်နံပါတ်ယူတဲ့စက် ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"怎么取号？","meaning_my":"အလှည့်နံပါတ် ဘယ်လိုယူရမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"在哪儿取号？","meaning_my":"အလှည့်နံပါတ်ကို ဘယ်မှာယူရမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"前面还有几桌？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်နှဖွဲ့ စောင့်နေသေးလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"前面还有三桌。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ သုံးဖွဲ့ စောင့်နေသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"过号了怎么办？","meaning_my":"ကိုယ့်အလှည့်နံပါတ် ကျော်သွားရင် ဘာလုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可能要重新取号，我帮您确认。","meaning_my":"နံပါတ်ပြန်ယူရနိုင်တယ်၊ စစ်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"过号要重新取吗？","meaning_my":"အလှည့်ကျော်သွားရင် နံပါတ်ပြန်ယူရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"排到我们了吗？","meaning_my":"အလှည့်ရောက်ပြီလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"快到了，再等一下。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်၊ ခဏ ထပ်စောင့်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"有空位叫我一声。","meaning_my":"နေရာလွတ်ရင် လှမ်းခေါ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S011_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"有位置了给我打个电话。","meaning_my":"နေရာလွတ်ရင် ဖုန်းဆက်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"我们三个人。","meaning_my":"သုံးယောက်ပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"有预约吗？","meaning_my":"ကြိုတင် စားပွဲနေရာ ယူထားလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，我订了六点的位子。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ ခြောက်နာရီအတွက် စားပွဲ ကြိုမှာထားတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我订了位。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲ ကြိုတင်မှာထားတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我们还有一个人没到。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ယောက် မရောက်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我们都到齐了。","meaning_my":"လူအားလုံး ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S016_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我们人齐了。","meaning_my":"လူစုံပြီ။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S016_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"可以先进去等吗？","meaning_my":"အထဲဝင်ပြီး အရင် စောင့်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，先到里面坐着等吧。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အထဲဝင်ထိုင်ပြီး စောင့်လို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"可以坐这张桌子吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီစားပွဲမှာ ထိုင်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S018_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，这桌没人。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဒီစားပွဲမှာ လူမရှိဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S018_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"这桌有人吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီစားပွဲမှာ လူရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"我们想坐靠窗的位置。","meaning_my":"ပြတင်းပေါက်ဘေးက နေရာမှာ ထိုင်ချင်ပါတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S020_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"靠窗还有座位吗？","meaning_my":"ပြတင်းပေါက်ဘေးမှာ နေရာလွတ်သေးလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S020_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"可以坐里面吗？","meaning_my":"အထဲမှာ ထိုင်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"里面暂时没位置，可以先坐外面。","meaning_my":"အထဲမှာ အခု နေရာမရှိသေးဘူး၊ အပြင်မှာ အရင်ထိုင်လို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"有包间吗？","meaning_my":"သီးသန့်ခန်း ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"包间现在没有了。","meaning_my":"သီးသန့်ခန်း အခု မရှိတော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S023","kind":"main","cn":"可以拼桌吗？","meaning_my":"တခြားသူတွေနဲ့ စားပွဲတစ်ဝိုင်းတည်း မျှထိုင်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S024","kind":"main","cn":"可以加一把椅子吗？","meaning_my":"ကုလားထိုင်တစ်လုံး ထပ်ထည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S024_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，我去拿一把。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ကုလားထိုင်တစ်လုံး သွားယူပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S024_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S025","kind":"main","cn":"可以换个安静点的位置吗？","meaning_my":"ပိုတိတ်ဆိတ်တဲ့ နေရာကို ပြောင်းထိုင်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S026","kind":"main","cn":"有儿童椅吗？","meaning_my":"ကလေးထိုင်ခုံ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S026_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，我帮您拿一把。","meaning_my":"ရှိပါတယ်၊ ကလေးထိုင်ခုံတစ်လုံး ယူပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.01-S026_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.01-S027","kind":"main