ly","cn":"这道比较清淡。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းက ဆီနဲ့အငန် သိပ်မများဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.02-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"这个里面放香菜吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီထဲမှာ နံနံပင် ထည့်ထားလား။","audio_file":"04.03.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"这是凉菜还是热菜？","meaning_my":"ဒါ အအေးဟင်းလား၊ အပူဟင်းလား။","audio_file":"04.03.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜是现做的吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို မှာမှ ချက်ပေးတာလား။","audio_file":"04.03.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我要一份这个。","meaning_my":"ဒါ တစ်ပွဲ ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我帮您下单。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ အော်ဒါ တင်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"这个来两份。","meaning_my":"ဒါ နှစ်ပွဲ ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"两碗米饭。","meaning_my":"ထမင်း နှစ်ပန်းကန် ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"来一壶茶。","meaning_my":"ရေနွေးကြမ်း တစ်ကရား ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"再加一壶茶。","meaning_my":"ရေနွေးကြမ်း တစ်ကရား ထပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"我要一瓶水。","meaning_my":"ရေသန့် တစ်ဘူး ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"再来一盘青菜。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းရွက်ဟင်း တစ်ပွဲ ထပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"再加一个菜。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတစ်ပွဲ ထပ်မှာမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还要加哪道菜？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဟင်း ထပ်မှာချင်လဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"有套餐吗？","meaning_my":"အစုံလိုက် အစားအစာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"就这些，麻烦了。","meaning_my":"ဒါပဲ မှာမယ်၊ ကျေးဇူးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"先这样，谢谢。","meaning_my":"အခုတော့ ဒါပဲ မှာမယ်၊ ကျေးဇူးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜先不要。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို အခုတော့ မမှာသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜能换成别的吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို တခြားဟင်းနဲ့ ပြောင်းပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"米饭可以免费续吗？","meaning_my":"ထမင်း ထပ်ယူရင် အခမဲ့လား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，米饭可以免费续。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ထမင်းကို အခမဲ့ ထပ်ယူလို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"再来一碗米饭。","meaning_my":"ထမင်း တစ်ပန်းကန် ထပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，再给您加一碗。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ ထမင်း တစ်ပန်းကန် ထပ်ထည့်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"有纸巾吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ရှူး ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，我拿给您。","meaning_my":"ရှိပါတယ်၊ ယူပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"有牙签吗？","meaning_my":"သွားကြားထိုးတံ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"米饭先上。","meaning_my":"ထမင်းကို အရင် တင်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"菜一起上。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတွေကို တစ်ခါတည်း တင်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"汤最后上。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းရည်ကို နောက်ဆုံးမှ တင်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"菜什么时候能上？","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတွေ ဘယ်တော့ ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S019_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还要十分钟左右。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် စောင့်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"能快点上菜吗？","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတွေ နည်းနည်း မြန်မြန် တင်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S020_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"麻烦快点上菜。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတွေ မြန်မြန်တင်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S020_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"我们的菜还没上。","meaning_my":"မှာထားတဲ့ ဟင်းတွေ မရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不好意思，我帮您问一下。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ မေးပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S021_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我们点的菜还没来。","meaning_my":"မှာထားတဲ့ ဟင်းတွေ မရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S021_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"帮我催一下菜。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတွေ မြန်မြန်ရအောင် မီးဖိုချောင်ကို မေးပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"我们点的菜上齐了吗？","meaning_my":"မှာထားတဲ့ ဟင်းတွေ အကုန် ရပြီလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还差一道菜。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတစ်ပွဲ ကျန်သေးတယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"我们没点这个。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို မမှာထားဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S024_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不好意思，我核对一下订单。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ အော်ဒါကို စစ်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S024_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S025","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜不要了。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း မလိုတော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S026","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜还没做的话，可以取消吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း မချက်ရသေးရင် အော်ဒါဖျက်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S026_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我确认一下厨房有没有开始做。","meaning_my":"မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ စချက်နေပြီလား စစ်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S026_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S027","kind":"main","cn":"还要加菜吗？","meaning_my":"ဟင်း ထပ်မှာဦးမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S027_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先不用了，谢谢。","meaning_my":"အခုတော့ မလိုသေးဘူး၊ ကျေးဇူးပါ။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S027_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.03.03-S028","kind":"main","cn":"剩下的菜能打包吗？","meaning_my":"ကျန်တဲ့ဟင်းတွေ ပါဆယ်ထုပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.03.03-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
